note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note OM-1 twin of v6-part-order.om: arguments are read left to right (OMEGESE 9.2), so the first
note argument's divide trap 2 wins over the second's conversion trap 5: exit 102.
fn g a ulong b ulong to ulong
ret add a b
end
fn main to int
z = ulong 0
m = long -1
r = g div 10 z ulong m
ret 0
end
